        "body": "<div>\n<p>Dear Reader,</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span>I am currently conducting an intensive longitudinal study (<a href=\"https://www.paradoxscience.nl/\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:blue;\">https://www.paradoxscience.nl/</span></a>), which is also quite intensive for our research team! </span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Replies may take longer than usual, but I will try to get back to you as quickly as I am able. Thank you for your understanding.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Best Regards,</p>\n<p>Rick van Logchem<span lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\n</div>",
