        "body": "<div>\n<p><span>I’m currently conducting an intensive longitudinal study (<a href=\"https://www.paradoxscience.nl/\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:blue;\">https://www.paradoxscience.nl/</span></a>), which is also quite intense for the researcher! My replies might take a bit longer than usual.</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Thanks for your understanding—I’ll get back to you as soon as I can<span lang=\"NL\">!</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Kind regards,</p>\n<p>Savannah</p>\n<p> </p>\n</div>",
