        "content_type": "text/html",
        "body": "<div>\n<p>Hi Mohammad,</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Yes, correct. The participants are already enrolled and we would like to have their phone number and corresponding ID.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Kind regards,</p>\n<p>Savannah</p>\n<p> </p>\n<div>\n<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"width:356.25pt;border-collapse:collapse;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:150.0pt;padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;\">\n<div>\n<p><b><span style=\"color:#002328;\">Dr. Savannah Boele</span></b><span style=\"color:#002328;\"><br>\n</span><b><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color:#ff9900;background:white;\">Postdoctoral researcher | Erasmus School of Social and Behavioural Sciences</span></b></p>\n<p><b><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color:#153d63;background:white;\">Researcher in project PARADOx | </span></b><span style=\"color:#002328;\"><a href=\"http://www.paradoxscience.nl/\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#467886;\">www.paradoxscience.nl/</span></a> | L</span><span style=\"color:#002328;\">aatste </span><span style=\"color:#153d63;\"><a href=\"https://mailchi.mp/43d123691084/guq1urhmn5-12703426?e=8fddfee5c1\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://mailchi.mp/43d123691084/guq1urhmn5-12703426?e=8fddfee5c1\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#153d63;\">nieuwsbrief</span></a></span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"background:white;\"> </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#201f1e;\">Daily parenting dynamics are adolescent-specific: <i><a href=\"https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s10964-023-01912-5\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s10964-023-01912-5\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#467886;\">Journal of Youth and Adolescence</span></a><br>\n</i></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"background:white;\">Working days: Monday, Tuesday, Thursday, &amp; Friday</span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"background:white;\"></span></p>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p> </p>\n<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"width:356.25pt;border-collapse:collapse;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p> </p>\n</div>\n<p> </p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<span class=\"js-signatureMarker\"></span><p><b>From:</b><span> Mohammad Hashemian &lt;sales@avicennaresearch.com&gt; <br>\n<b>Sent:</b> Thursday, October 17, 2024 12:31 PM<br>\n<b>To:</b> Savannah Boele &lt;s.boele@essb.eur.nl&gt;<br>\n<b>Cc:</b> Rick van Logchem &lt;vanlogchem@essb.eur.nl&gt;<br>\n<b>Subject:</b> RE: Avicenna ID's and phone numbers participants?</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Hi Dr. Boele,</p>\n<div>\n<p> </p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p>Hope you are doing well. I may be able to help with this question.</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p> </p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p>Participants are already enrolled in this study. Correct? Our records show there are the following number of participants in each study:</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p> </p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p>study_id | count</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p>----------+-------</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p>4044 | 343</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p>4045 | 334</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p>4050 | 249</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p>4051 | 240</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p> </p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p>Total of 1145 participants. So I believe you want the Avicenna ID and associated phone number for these? Right? If yes, I certainly can provide them to you.</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p> </p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p>Best,</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p>Mohammad</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p> </p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p>--<br> Avicenna Research (formerly Ethica Data)</p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p>4109 - 295 Adelaide St W, Toronto, ON M5V 0L4, Canada</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p>Email: <a href=\"mailto:sales@avicennaresearch.com\">sales@avicennaresearch.com</a> - Web: <a href=\"https://avicennaresearch.com/\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://avicennaresearch.com</a><br> --</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p> </p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>On Thursday, October 17, 2024 at 4:28:46 AM, Savannah Boele wrote:</p>\n<div>\n<p>Hi Amin,</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Next Monday, we will begin the ESM and daily diaries for our four studies (4044, 4045, 4050, 4051). We have already requested participants to share their Avicenna ID with is, so that we can link their personal information, specifically their registered phone number, to their anonymous Avicenna ID. This is necessary to send personalized messages regarding their compliance through WhatsApp during the studies. However, to date, we still do not have each participant's ID. As we are close to starting, we were wondering whether there might be another way to gather their phone numbers.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>We are unable to locate this information through the researcher's dashboard. We can only see the list of Avicenna IDs. Is there a way to determine which phone number corresponds to each ID?</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Any assistance you can provide would be much appreciated.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Kind regards,</p>\n<p>Savannah and Rick</p>\n<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"width:356.25pt;border-collapse:collapse;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:356.25pt;padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;\">\n<div>\n<p><b><span style=\"color:#002328;\">Dr. Savannah Boele</span></b><span style=\"color:#002328;\"><br>\n</span><b><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color:#ff9900;background:white;\">Postdoctoral researcher | Erasmus School of Social and Behavioural Sciences</span></b></p>\n<p><b><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color:#153d63;background:white;\">Researcher in project PARADOx | </span></b><span style=\"color:#002328;\"><a href=\"http://www.paradoxscience.nl/\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">www.paradoxscience.nl/</a> | Laatste </span><span style=\"color:#153d63;\"><a href=\"https://mailchi.mp/43d123691084/guq1urhmn5-12703426?e=8fddfee5c1\" title=\"https://mailchi.mp/43d123691084/guq1urhmn5-12703426?e=8fddfee5c1\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#153d63;\">nieuwsbrief</span></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#201f1e;\">Daily parenting dynamics are adolescent-specific: <i><a href=\"https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s10964-023-01912-5\" title=\"https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s10964-023-01912-5\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Journal of Youth and Adolescence</a><br>\n</i></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"background:white;\">Working days: Monday, Tuesday, Thursday, &amp; Friday</span></p>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p> </p>\n<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"width:356.25pt;border-collapse:collapse;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p> </p>\n</div>\n<p> </p>\n</blockquote>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p> </p>\n</div>\n<p> </p>\n</div>\n</div>",
